SPRINT_2.md
Sprint 2 – 
1. Sprint Goal & Scope
Build a secure catalog database to manage categories, products, variants, and SKUs. This sprint focuses on CRUD operations, data integrity, authentication, and testing.

2. Sprint 1 Reuse
•	Frontend: React.js
•	Backend: Node.js + Express.js
•	Database: MySQL
•	Authentication: JWT
•	Existing Users table reused.

3. Updated ER Diagram
Er Diagram
CATEGORY ||--o{ PRODUCT : contains
PRODUCT ||--o{ VARIANT : has
VARIANT ||--o{ SKU : materializes
PRODUCT ||--o{ ASSET : displays
PRODUCT ||--o{ CART_ITEM : selected
SKU ||--o{ ORDER_ITEM : sold

4. Data Dictionary
Table	Main Fields
Category	id, name, slug, parent_ id, status
Product	id, category _id, name, slug, description, status
Variant	id, product _id, option _value
SKU	id, variant_ id,  sku_ code, price, stock, status
Asset	id, product_ id, image_ url,  alt_ text
Specification	id, product _id, specifications

5. API Routes
Method	Route	Purpose
POST	 /api/v1/admin/products	Create Product
PATCH	/api/v1/admin/products/	Update Product
POST	/api/v1/admin/products//skus	 Add SKU
PATCH	/api/v1/admin/skus/	Update SKU
GET	/api/v1/admin/products	View Products
POST	/api/v1/admin/categories	Create Category
GET	/api/v1/admin/categories	View Categories
